			"styles": "\n\t/* CSS has no line comments: a `//` inside a function's parens is two `/` delimiters, and\n\tthe argument list normalizes around it as any other */\n\ta {\n\t\tcolor: fn(//x, 0.1);\n\t}\n\t@supports (a: fn(//x, 0.1)) {\n\t}\n\t@import 'a.css' screen fn(//x, 0.1);\n\t@import ur fn(//x, 0.1);\n",
